      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orrum%2C_North_Carolina",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Geographically, Orrum sits west of Fairmont and east of Boardman, nestled between the Lumber River and the South Carolina border.",
